# Force LF line endings for shell scripts regardless of the checking-out platform's
# core.autocrlf setting, so build.sh/view.sh remain runnable under WSL/Git Bash after a
# Windows checkout ("build.sh: line N: syntax error: unexpected end of file" is the
# symptom of a CRLF checkout mangling if/fi and do/done matching).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
